alo de confianza del 95 % de 2,5 a 4,4. En diciembre se adjudicó el 18 % de los contratos junto al límite, mientras que diciembre supone el 13 % de todos sus contratos de servicios y suministros. Los contratos junto al límite se reparten entre 59 adjudicatarios distintos. El contrato [1], de 14.250 euros, se adjudicó en diciembre de 2025.\nQué no pueden demostrar: El hecho de que muchos contratos estén cerca del límite no indica que se hayan salido de él ni que haya existido malversación. Puede deberse a razones legales o a necesidades específicas.\nQué se puede revisar: Es necesario comprobar si los contratos [1], [2], [3] atienden la misma necesidad y si el adjudicatario A repite contratos en áreas distintas. También se debe revisar si los contratos de diciembre están relacionados con una misma iniciativa.","en":"What the data shows: Between 2023 and 2025, this body awarded 92 minor contracts for services and supplies above 14,000 and up to 15,000 euros, just under the legal limit. If those amounts were spread as in the band immediately below, 27.4 contracts would be expected. The observed-to-expected ratio is 3.4, with a 95% confidence interval of 2.5 to 4.4. December accounts for 18% of the contracts just under the limit, compared with 13% of all its services and supplies contracts. The awardee with the most contracts just under the limit, called awardee A here, has 6. Contract [1], for 14,250 euros, was awarded in December 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The concentration of contracts in December does not indicate improper activity. Similar trends could result from seasonal demand or budget cycles. The number of contracts with small amounts under the limit does not prove misconduct, as market prices or budget constraints may explain them.\nWhat can be checked: Check the distribution of contracts by month to see if December's share is unusual. Review awardee A's contracts to see if they repeat the same need. Examine contract [1] to confirm if the amount was just under the limit and if it aligns with standard pricing.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["DH%2BlAp3IsXacCF8sV%2BqtYA%3D%3D","r38vwy3fyWwtm4eBPtV6eQ%3D%3D","VjtisVd5eivI8aL3PRS10Q%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-16"}}